.TH PSPathJoin 3 2023-12-03 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSPathJoin

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/utils.h>

.I
char  *
.br
\fBPSPathJoin\fR(\fIint count\fR, \fI...\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Joins multiple file path components into a single path string.
.br
Argument \fIcount\fR is used to specify how many components will be consumed.
.br
Path components must be passed as variadic arguments.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
String containing the joined path or \fINULL\fR if something goes               wrong. Returned string is allocated into heap, so it's up               to the developer to free it as soon as it is no longer needed.
